[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 8116.79, "timestamp": "02:15:16", "text": "我需要在这里找到金丝雀。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8121.589, "timestamp": "02:15:21", "text": "游戏里除了这些武器，就只有一条毯子了。 你必须去"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8124.47, "timestamp": "02:15:24", "text": "避难所。 新增目的地。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8134.39, "timestamp": "02:15:34", "text": "巴里塔市。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8137.109, "timestamp": "02:15:37", "text": "哦，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8139.27, "timestamp": "02:15:39", "text": "上面是什么样子？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8141.109, "timestamp": "02:15:41", "text": "在哪里？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8142.87, "timestamp": "02:15:42", "text": "在城市里。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8143.27, "timestamp": "02:15:43", "text": "城市。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8145.109, "timestamp": "02:15:45", "text": "这很危险。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8148.149, "timestamp": "02:15:48", "text": "整个东西都被沙子吞噬了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8148.95, "timestamp": "02:15:48", "text": "我们来看看这个东西。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8151.589, "timestamp": "02:15:51", "text": "那里已经没有人居住了。 你走在"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8155.03, "timestamp": "02:15:55", "text": "街上就能看到它们的标志。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8157.669, "timestamp": "02:15:57", "text": "褪色的壁画、"}]